WEBVTT

00:00:00.280 --> 00:00:06.693
It is nine forty-seven. The store is closed, but Mika is still counting every shelf by hand.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:15.409
And one wrong number can mean an empty shelf, a lost sale, and another late night.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:27.113
Then Mika finds OXPOS, and everything clicks. Checkout, stock, and reports finally work as one.

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:38.138
Now every sale updates inventory instantly. No extra tally. No second notebook. No guesswork.

00:00:40.280 --> 00:00:46.328
Low-stock alerts show what needs attention, while clear reports turn today's sales into tomorrow's decisions.

00:00:50.280 --> 00:00:58.593
So Mika closes on time and grows with confidence. Stop counting the past. Start running what is next, with OXPOS.
